ve another Florida LLC? We file its Protected Series Designations — no Articles fee.\n\nCertificate of Status\n\nThe state's certificate that your LLC is active and in good standing — banks and lenders often ask for a recent one.\n\n$5\n\nCertified Copy of the Articles\n\nA state-certified copy of your filed Articles of Organization.\n\n$30\n\nAccount\nEMAIL\nscope@example.test\n\nYou sign in with this address, and it's where documents and notices go.\n\nChange email\nPASSWORD\n\nChanging it signs out every other device.\n\nChange password\n\nDocuments are download-only. If something looks wrong or missing, email support@myfloridaseriesllc.com."}
